1
00:00:00,141 --> 00:00:02,641
(Leonard:)-Come on. It's okay.
-No, it's not okay!

2
00:00:02,811 --> 00:00:06,191
(Penny:)Look at me, okay? I took a temp job
as a waitress forever ago,

3
00:00:06,347 --> 00:00:09,127
(Penny:)and I'm still doing it.
I can't quit, because guess what?

4
00:00:09,284 --> 00:00:10,524
(Penny:)I can't do anything else.

5
00:00:10,685 --> 00:00:15,195
(Penny:)And I finally get my big break,
and it goes away! I'm such a mess.

6
00:00:15,356 --> 00:00:16,856
(Leonard:)-No, you're not.
-Really?

7
00:00:17,025 --> 00:00:18,195
'Cause this morning at Starbucks,

8
00:00:18,359 --> 00:00:21,499
(Penny:)a pair of old underwear
fell out cf my pant leg!

9
00:00:23,698 --> 00:00:26,338
(Penny:)And it wasn't the only
one in there.

10
00:00:28,002 --> 00:00:31,542
(Leonard:)Okay, listen to me,
this is just a minor setback.

11
00:00:31,706 --> 00:00:34,316
(Penny:)No, it's not, okay? I've been out
here for, like, ten years!

12
00:00:34,475 --> 00:00:37,885
-I've nothing to show for it!
-Well, you have me.

13
00:00:39,214 --> 00:00:41,384
(Penny:)You're right.

14
00:00:42,317 --> 00:00:43,487
(Penny:)I do have you.

15
00:00:44,819 --> 00:00:45,959
Mmm.

16
00:00:47,388 --> 00:00:49,058
(Penny:)Let's get married.

17
00:00:51,059 --> 00:00:52,059
(Leonard:)What?

18
00:00:55,730 --> 00:00:57,210
Whoo.

19
00:00:58,833 --> 00:01:03,023
(Penny:)Leonard Hofstadter,
will you marry me?

